      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LADY GUNAI (2) flew the lids with a fast early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow fourth (16.66) over 300m at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Can atone. DUNDEE SKYE (1) is better than last start when fourth (30.11) in a Grade 4/5 at Sandown over 515m. Hard to go past form at this journey. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Key player if finds best. HAPPY CHICK (4) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 300m behind Santana Boy (16.99) in a Free For All. Scored at her previous run. Must be included in calculations. STARLIGHT RIOT (6) profiles nicely over this trip.",
